      {
        "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.CfgDialogGroup, Assembly-CSharp",
        "desc": null,
        "textMaxIndex": 0,
        "textGroupId": "1000160021_8",
        "useFixedDialogGroup": false,
        "fixedDialogGroupId": 0,
        "dialogs": {
          "$type": "System.Collections.Generic.List`1[[miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp]], mscorlib",
          "$values": [
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "咕咕",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1000160021_4057902497_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "咕～！很高兴能为您介绍\n「种星奇遇记」奇物获取规则。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1000160021_4057902497_content",
                "value": "咕～！很高兴能为您介绍\n「种星奇遇记」奇物获取规则。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 4057902497
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "咕咕",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1000160021_4057902498_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "想要兑换当季奇物，请先购买<style=Highlight>奇物相遇卡</style>。\n购买后，完成相遇条件，\n在<style=Highlight>奇物商城</style>中就可以<style=Highlight>兑换本季奇物</style>了咕～。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1000160021_4057902498_content",
                "value": "想要兑换当季奇物，请先购买<style=Highlight>奇物相遇卡</style>。\n购买后，完成相遇条件，\n在<style=Highlight>奇物商城</style>中就可以<style=Highlight>兑换本季奇物</style>了咕～。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 4057902498
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "咕咕",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1000160021_4057902499_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "兑换需要的<style=Highlight>奇迹络米</style>，\n可完成<style=Highlight>「络米足迹」</style>中的每日任务，\n或购买<style=Highlight>奇迹络米礼包</style>获得。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1000160021_4057902499_content",
                "value": "兑换需要的<style=Highlight>奇迹络米</style>，\n可完成<style=Highlight>「络米足迹」</style>中的每日任务，\n或购买<style=Highlight>奇迹络米礼包</style>获得。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 4057902499
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "咕咕",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1000160021_4057902500_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "每批上新奇物都可兑换殊礼<style=Highlight>奇迹星铃</style>——\n奇迹星铃可兑换商城中央兑换区的至高奇物<style=Highlight>星铃赠礼</style>。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1000160021_4057902500_content",
                "value": "每批上新奇物都可兑换殊礼<style=Highlight>奇迹星铃</style>——\n奇迹星铃可兑换商城中央兑换区的至高奇物<style=Highlight>星铃赠礼</style>。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 4057902500
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "咕咕",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1000160021_4057902501_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "奇物会分批上新到奇物商城。\n遇见更多故事，解锁更多奇物兑换，\n祝愿您在星球季活动中，收获快乐咕！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1000160021_4057902501_content",
                "value": "奇物会分批上新到奇物商城。\n遇见更多故事，解锁更多奇物兑换，\n祝愿您在星球季活动中，收获快乐咕！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 4057902501
            }
